# Build-context allowlist for services/indexer/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` over the context's
# `.dockerignore`, so each component scopes its own context and no shared root
# file has to know about all of them. The legacy (non-BuildKit) builder ignores
# this file entirely — reproduce the image with `docker buildx build`.
#
# Allowlist, not denylist, and deliberately so: a denylist admits every
# newly-added top-level directory silently, credentials and large fixture
# corpora included. Omitting something needed here fails the `deps` stage COPY
# instead, which is the failure mode to prefer.
#
# The manifest list below is mirrored by the `deps` stage COPY. The two serve
# different jobs (context filter vs. copy); a mismatch fails the build rather
# than producing a wrong image.
**

!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!package.json

!services/indexer/**

!apps/web/package.json
!services/api/package.json
!packages/api-types/package.json
!packages/chain-client/package.json
!packages/db-indexed/package.json
!packages/fixtures/package.json

# Never in context even though services/indexer/** re-included it above.
services/indexer/node_modules/**
services/indexer/argocd/**
